'''Sant Cristòfor Els Aiguamolls Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Sant Cristòfor Els Aiguamolls}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: EAI, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: EAIB) is a domestic airport serving the northern districts of [[Sant Cristòfor]], in the [[Els Aiguamolls]] comarca of [[Estret Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is located in the wetlands north of the capital and primarily serves the elite residential districts and wealthy travellers of the northern ciutats. It is jet-capable and is served by [[Aeroístmus]], which operates essential services from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

